 Monitor student completion of co-op and work-term requirements;
 Follow up on outstanding documentation and provide status updates to staff and faculty as required;
 Track and report on student progression throughout the co-op program, maintaining accurate records and identifying students requiring additional support or intervention;
 Support the administration of the co-op recruitment and work-term cycle by maintaining databases, monitoring key deadlines, and ensuring timely communication with students and stakeholders; and
